WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.413 --> 00:00:03.082
Welcome to Tranquillum House.

00:00:04.853 --> 00:00:06.480
Masha:
You want to get well?

00:00:06.696 --> 00:00:08.239
You want to heal?

00:00:08.676 --> 00:00:11.179
Surrender yourself to me.

00:00:12.764 --> 00:00:14.932
I have been feeling
rather unwell lately.

00:00:15.618 --> 00:00:17.578
Masha: In 10 days,
you will be transformed.

00:00:17.977 --> 00:00:18.894
(gasps)

00:00:19.155 --> 00:00:20.448
(cymbals echo)

00:00:20.498 --> 00:00:22.083
♪♪

00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:23.293
Aaaaah!

00:00:23.293 --> 00:00:25.170
Masha:
We are on the precipice

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.422
of something great.

